Andrew Mclean -- extreme skier Dan Stone -- glaciologist Lisel Clark -- producer John Armstrong -- cameraman Rob Raker -- assistant cameraman and sound recording The team not only made the first ascent from the east side but also performed scientific research into snow accumulation at different elevations as well as taking the first ground based GPS reading from the summit . The GPS reading gave the elevation of the highest point in Antarctica as 16,077 ft ( 4,900 m ) , eclipsing the earlier established heights recorded in 1959 and 1979 . Another first was the successful aircraft landing of a Twin Otter on the Upper Dater Glacier on the eastern slopes of Mount Vinson . NOVA named the production `` Mountain of Ice '' , which first aired on PBS in February 2003 . Maps ( edit ) Vinson Massif . Scale 1 : 250 000 topographic map . Reston , Virginia : US Geological Survey , 1988 . D. Gildea and C. Rada . Vinson Massif and the Sentinel Range . Scale 1 : 50 000 topographic map . Omega Foundation , 2007 .","entities":[],"facts":[]}
